 1: # Arsitektur Proyek — FAST Landing Page
 2: 
 3: Struktur mengikuti **FAST Design System** (`/.cursor/rules/fast-design-system.md`): pemisahan UI primitives, layout global, section per halaman, dan halaman tipis sebagai composer.
 4: 
 5: ## Struktur folder
 6: 
 7: ```
 8: src/
 9: ├── App.tsx                 # Root: BrowserRouter + routes
10: ├── main.tsx                # Entry Vite
11: ├── index.css               # Tailwind v4 + token warna brand
12: ├── i18n.ts                 # (opsional) i18n
13: │
14: ├── config/                 # Konstanta teknis & SEO (bukan copy panjang)
15: │   ├── site.ts             # Nav, kontak, re-export dari content
16: │   └── seo.ts              # Meta title/description per route
17: │
18: ├── content/                # Sumber teks resmi — mirror docs/CONTENT.md
19: │   ├── global.ts           # Header, Footer, kontak global
20: │   ├── home.ts             # Halaman Beranda (fase berikutnya)
21: │   ├── about.ts            # Tentang Kami
22: │   ├── lithium-fire-safety.ts
23: │   ├── contact.ts
24: │   └── index.ts            # Barrel export
25: │
26: ├── routes/
27: │   └── index.tsx           # React Router + MainLayout
28: │
29: ├── pages/                  # Composer: SEO + urutan section (tipis)
30: │   ├── HomePage.tsx
31: │   ├── AboutPage.tsx
32: │   ├── LithiumFireSafetyPage.tsx
33: │   └── ContactPage.tsx
34: │
35: └── components/
36:     ├── layout/             # Header, Footer, MainLayout
37:     ├── ui/                 # Button, ButtonLink, Card, Badge (reusable)
38:     ├── seo/                # PageSeo (react-helmet-async)
39:     └── sections/           # Blok konten per halaman
40:         ├── home/
41:         ├── about/
42:         ├── contact/
43:         ├── lithium-fire-safety/
44:         └── shared/         # Section dipakai >1 halaman (mis. lokasi kantor)
45: ```
46: 
47: ## Alur data konten
48: 
49: 1. Copywriting resmi ada di `docs/CONTENT.md`.
50: 2. Implementasi TypeScript di `src/content/*.ts` — **jangan mengarang teks** di komponen.
51: 3. `src/config/site.ts` mengekspor nav/kontak untuk routing & link (`tel:`, `mailto:`).
52: 4. Section/page hanya mengimpor dari `content/` + merender UI.
53: 
